('01M4D6CBPCFMSNZRYBXXKM8MV4', '01M4D6BGEJTNA5C60HM189RKHW', '01M4D6BGHAKBD28V6BPQ7S7XE3', 'Rename the unit to Data Systems and Platforms Department to reflect the platform work it now carries.', 'The department has run the environmental data platforms since 2025 and its current name no longer describes the mandate.', 'open', NULL, NULL, '2026-10-05T07:24:26.700Z'),
('01M4D6CBPCE3BCK417VHJCG1K9', '01M4D6BGEJTNA5C60HM189RKHW', '01M4D6BGHAKBD28V6BPQ7S7XE3', 'Add a Data Engineering Section under the department with the four engineers who joined in Q2.', 'The section exists in practice; recording it lets the HR dashboard and the handover process see the team.', 'resolved', '01M4D6BGH96DBS87XWT8FQFFGW', '2026-09-19T07:24:26.700Z', '2026-09-17T07:24:26.700Z');
