('01M4D6BRFC8T8A2XXKWF5SNDZ7', 'PRJ-01a Smart Metering Rollout: what the knowledge says', 'PRJ-01a طرح العدادات الذكية: ماذا تقول المعرفة', 'A short two-voice episode on PRJ-01a Smart Metering Rollout, grounded in the selected EnviroAI content.', 'حلقة قصيرة بصوتين عن PRJ-01a طرح العدادات الذكية، مبنية على المحتوى المختار في EnviroAI.', 'en', 'overview', '{"kind":"node","ids":["01M4D6BHKA9AZC8YTTA3NDD1CC"],"labelEn":"PRJ-01a Smart Metering Rollout","labelAr":"PRJ-01a طرح العدادات الذكية","outcomeCode":"eco_growth"}', '{"title_en":"PRJ-01a Smart Metering Rollout: what the knowledge says","title_ar":"PRJ-01a طرح العدادات الذكية: ماذا تقول المعرفة","description_en":"A short two-voice episode on PRJ-01a Smart Metering Rollout, grounded in the selected EnviroAI content.","description_ar":"حلقة قصيرة بصوتين عن PRJ-01a طرح العدادات الذكية، مبنية على المحتوى المختار في EnviroAI.","segments":[{"speaker":"hamad","text":"Welcome to EnviroAI Briefing Cast, from the Programme Office. Today we are talking about PRJ-01a Smart Metering Rollout, and it matters because it touches the daily work of delivering the national strategy. With me is Dr. Mariam. Welcome, doctor.","source_mention":null},{"speaker":"mariam","text":"Thank you Hamad, and hello to everyone listening to the Cast. The material in front of us today is rich, so let us begin.","source_mention":null},{"speaker":"hamad","text":"Tell us about D1. What does the material say here?","source_mention":null},{"speaker":"mariam","text":"Deliverable D1 of PRJ-01a: scope, governance, and the delivery plan. Completion 55 percent, adoption 40 percent.","source_mention":"as D1 records"},{"speaker":"hamad","text":"Tell us about D2. What does the material say here?","source_mention":null},{"speaker":"mariam","text":"Deliverable D2 of PRJ-01a: functional requirements and the target operating model. Completion 68 percent, adoption 51 percent.","source_mention":"as D2 records"},{"speaker":"hamad","text":"Tell us about D3. What does the material say here?","source_mention":null},{"speaker":"mariam","text":"Deliverable D3 of PRJ-01a: pilot results, adoption figures, and corrective actions. Completion 81 percent, adoption 62 percent.","source_mention":"as D3 records"},{"speaker":"hamad","text":"Before we close, the numbers moment. What is the one figure to remember from this episode?","source_mention":null},{"speaker":"mariam","text":"The figure to keep: Deliverable D1 of PRJ-01a: scope, governance, and the delivery plan. Completion 55 percent, adoption 40 percent.","source_mention":"according to D1"},{"speaker":"mariam","text":"And the lesson to keep: knowledge recorded in its moment saves the next team months of rediscovery. Capture what you learned in EnviroAI before the project forgets it.","source_mention":null},{"speaker":"hamad","text":"Thank you Dr. Mariam, and thank you for listening. That was EnviroAI Briefing Cast. Until next time.","source_mention":null}],"estimated_seconds":90,"sources":[{"resource_type":"node","resource_id":"01M4D6BHKA9AZC8YTTA3NDD1CC","title":"PRJ-01a: Smart Metering Rollout","page":null,"excerpt":"Install smart meters for household and commercial customers in priority cities.","edition":"nes3","verified":false,"n":1},{"resource_type":"document","resource_id":"01M4D6BP391HP521RHH956AFDR","title":"Deliverable D1 of Project PRJ-01a: PRJ-01a Inception Report","page":null,"excerpt":"Deliverable D1 of PRJ-01a: scope, governance, and the delivery plan. Completion 55 percent, adoption 40 percent.","classification":2,"verified":true,"n":2},{"resource_type":"document","resource_id":"01M4D6BQ9BQXEJQE68A68JYGVB","title":"Deliverable D2 of Project PRJ-01a: PRJ-01a Requirements and Design Specification","page":null,"excerpt":"Deliverable D2 of PRJ-01a: functional requirements and the target operating model. Completion 68 percent, adoption 51 percent.","classification":2,"verified":true,"n":3},{"resource_type":"document","resource_id":"01M4D6BQ9X1TE89QB7RTD4XDCE","title":"Deliverable 