('01M4D6BRFW9ZTYKY20DKSM1CK8', 'Agriculture and Food Security: what the knowledge says', 'الأمن الغذائي والزراعة: ماذا تقول المعرفة', 'A short two-voice episode on Agriculture and Food Security, grounded in the selected EnviroAI content.', 'حلقة قصيرة بصوتين عن الأمن الغذائي والزراعة، مبنية على المحتوى المختار في EnviroAI.', 'en', 'numbers', '{"kind":"topic","ids":[],"labelEn":"Agriculture and Food Security","labelAr":"الأمن الغذائي والزراعة","query":"agriculture food security irrigation efficiency","outcomeCode":"fiscal_sust"}', '{"title_en":"Agriculture and Food Security: what the knowledge says","title_ar":"الأمن الغذائي والزراعة: ماذا تقول المعرفة","description_en":"A short two-voice episode on Agriculture and Food Security, grounded in the selected EnviroAI content.","description_ar":"حلقة قصيرة بصوتين عن الأمن الغذائي والزراعة، مبنية على المحتوى المختار في EnviroAI.","segments":[{"speaker":"hamad","text":"Welcome to EnviroAI Briefing Cast, from the Programme Office. Today we are talking about Agriculture and Food Security, and it matters because it touches the daily work of delivering the national strategy. With me is Dr. Mariam. Welcome, doctor.","source_mention":null},{"speaker":"mariam","text":"Thank you Hamad, and hello to everyone listening to the Cast. The material in front of us today is rich, so let us begin.","source_mention":null},{"speaker":"hamad","text":"Tell us about D1 of PRJ-06a. What does the material say here?","source_mention":null},{"speaker":"mariam","text":"PRJ-06a Inception Report","source_mention":"as D1 of PRJ-06a records"},{"speaker":"hamad","text":"Tell us about D3 of PRJ-06a. What does the material say here?","source_mention":null},{"speaker":"mariam","text":"PRJ-06a Pilot Evaluation Report","source_mention":"as D3 of PRJ-06a records"},{"speaker":"hamad","text":"Tell us about D2 of PRJ-06a. What does the material say here?","source_mention":null},{"speaker":"mariam","text":"PRJ-06a Requirements and Design Specification","source_mention":"as D2 of PRJ-06a records"},{"speaker":"hamad","text":"Tell us about D1 of PRJ-06b. What does the material say here?","source_mention":null},{"speaker":"mariam","text":"PRJ-06b Inception Report","source_mention":"as D1 of PRJ-06b records"},{"speaker":"hamad","text":"Before we close, the numbers moment. What is the one figure to remember from this episode?","source_mention":null},{"speaker":"mariam","text":"The figure to keep: PRJ-06a Inception Report","source_mention":"according to D1 of PRJ-06a"},{"speaker":"mariam","text":"And the lesson to keep: knowledge recorded in its moment saves the next team months of rediscovery. Capture what you learned in EnviroAI before the project forgets it.","source_mention":null},{"speaker":"hamad","text":"Thank you Dr. Mariam, and thank you for listening. That was EnviroAI Briefing Cast. Until next time.","source_mention":null}],"estimated_seconds":78,"sources":[{"resource_type":"document","resource_id":"01M4D6BQQ9C10QB4KX923E0E5M","title":"Deliverable D1 of Project PRJ-06a: PRJ-06a Inception Report","page":1,"excerpt":"PRJ-06a Inception Report\nDeliverable D1 of project PRJ-06a, milestone M1. Prepared for the Programme Office under Agriculture and Food Security.\n1. Context\nDrip and Pivot Conversion Support is a delivery project under target O2.T1 (Cover 75 percent of irrigated area with efficien","lang":"en","classification":2,"verified":true,"n":1},{"resource_type":"document","resource_id":"01M4D6BQR8AKMW9Y58RP0CTA7M","title":"Deliverable D3 of Project PRJ-06a: PRJ-06a Pilot Evaluation Report","page":1,"excerpt":"PRJ-06a Pilot Evaluation Report\nDeliverable D3 of project PRJ-06a, milestone M3. Prepared for the Programme Office under Agriculture and Food Security.\n1. Context\nDrip and Pivot Conversion Support is a delivery project under target O2.T1 (Cover 75 percent of irrigated area with e","lang":"en","classification":2,"verified":true,"n":2},{"resource_type":"document","resource_id":"01M4D6BQQYD25V6VNNY77R1NPT","title"