The environmental monitoring round for 2026 is 70 percent complete. The next milestone is the quality review on the 15th of next month, and the field teams already have their schedules.', 'We decided in March to move field data capture to tablets after the 2025 pilot cut the number of repeat site visits; the Programme Director approved it and the budget came from the data programme.

